    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>BATTLELINE\u00a0</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Battleline</strong></i> is an indie VR shooter created by a solo developer, offering a free and immersive first look at the groundbreaking weapon systems and mechanics at the heart of the <i>Battleline</i> experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>FREE DEMO\u00a0</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The release of the free demo serves as both a training ground for players and a testing ground for future features, allowing the community to shape the evolution of the game. Explore the interactive training range and dynamic killhouse, where you can master weapons meticulously recreated from iconic eras  and  conflicts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a labor of passion, <i><strong>Battleline</strong>\u00a0</i>strives to push the boundaries of VR realism and storytelling, providing players with a glimpse of the full game\u2019s potential. Your feedback will help refine and expand this ambitious project into a fully-fledged historical VR experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive &amp; Realistic Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/3475ba0d09911985bc1734099226ae66.avif?t=1750809724\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive VR Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/fe1b73910c8342756419597e05386c23.poster.avif?t=1750809724\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/fe1b73910c8342756419597e05386c23.webm?t=1750809724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/fe1b73910c8342756419597e05386c23.mp4?t=1750809724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expanding Weapons &amp; Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/a81a8ade30d1da41363202fb82f32e16.avif?t=1750809724\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in, lock and load, and join the journey as we build <i><strong>Battleline</strong></i> together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;</strong>The <strong>screenshots</strong> shown are from <i><strong>Battleline - The Range</strong></i>, a free demo showcasing the game's weapon mechanics and training environments. These are <strong>placeholder images</strong>, and the final game will feature expanded environments, battles across different war eras, and additional content. Stay tuned for updates as development progresses!<strong>&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Us on Discord<br>&quot;Link is attached to the side panel&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>BATTLELINE\u00a0</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Battleline</strong></i> is an indie VR shooter created by a solo developer, offering a free and immersive first look at the groundbreaking weapon systems and mechanics at the heart of the <i>Battleline</i> experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>FREE DEMO\u00a0</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The release of the free demo serves as both a training ground for players and a testing ground for future features, allowing the community to shape the evolution of the game. Explore the interactive training range and dynamic killhouse, where you can master weapons meticulously recreated from iconic eras  and  conflicts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a labor of passion, <i><strong>Battleline</strong>\u00a0</i>strives to push the boundaries of VR realism and storytelling, providing players with a glimpse of the full game\u2019s potential. Your feedback will help refine and expand this ambitious project into a fully-fledged historical VR experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive &amp; Realistic Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/3475ba0d09911985bc1734099226ae66.avif?t=1750809724\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive VR Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/fe1b73910c8342756419597e05386c23.poster.avif?t=1750809724\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/fe1b73910c8342756419597e05386c23.webm?t=1750809724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/fe1b73910c8342756419597e05386c23.mp4?t=1750809724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expanding Weapons &amp; Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493640/extras/a81a8ade30d1da41363202fb82f32e16.avif?t=1750809724\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in, lock and load, and join the journey as we build <i><strong>Battleline</strong></i> together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;</strong>The <strong>screenshots</strong> shown are from <i><strong>Battleline - The Range</strong></i>, a free demo showcasing the game's weapon mechanics and training environments. These are <strong>placeholder images</strong>, and the final game will feature expanded environments, battles across different war eras, and additional content. Stay tuned for updates as development progresses!<strong>&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Us on Discord<br>&quot;Link is attached to the side panel&quot;</p>",
